                "quoted_status_profile_username": "liz_elkind",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Millions of hardworking Americans are being hit with higher premiums because of short-sighted Democratic decisions. These were COVID-era tax credits that Democrats set to expire, and they\u2019ve failed to lower the cost of healthcare. Without real, meaningful reform, healthcare will only keep getting more expensive. When the government reopens, we\u2019re ready to fight for solutions that protect families and lower costs, but I will not do that while Democrats hold the federal government hostage.",
