                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am encouraged by this positive step toward ensuring the continuity of care for our community. These hospitals are essential to Scranton and the broader region, not only as providers of critical health services, but as major employers and anchors of our local economy.\n\nMy team and I will continue to work closely with all local, state, and federal leaders involved to help bring this agreement across the finish line and ensure that quality, accessible care remains available to everyone in Northeastern Pennsylvania.\n\nhttps://t.co/tJOYmntIMc",
